- **Turning `pattern-coherence` into a scanner.** That library family has 6 patterns (causal clarity, scope boundaries, evidence alignment…). A rule-based check for each, run over the 823 proposals, would be a separate piece of work. It would slot into the stepper's pattern section once the display works.
